  "note": "Big drop: 5 new files plus a schema change. launch_status.xlsx (as of Sat 13:00): Standard 86k left at 6,000/h (~14h), Collector's 18.9k left at 900/h (~21h of the ~23 packing hours left), so Collector's has almost no slack. New CPO memo: Collector's gets short parts first, nothing ships without Quality release, rush/air above policy goes to the CPO within the hour, and he wants one page on what can stop a line, not forty dashboards. Engineering changes: CMP-GAM-004 (Standard) moves to rev C and rev B must NOT be packed; CMP-GAM-009 (Collector's) moves to rev B but rev A can be used up; CMP-GAM-010 is now flagged critical, yet its two open sea shipments arrive in December. products.csv renamed plan_weekly_units to weekly_plan_qty and added day_one_qty and valid_from, so hardcoded parsers break."
 },
